    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/285c9be6d6b972fb1dde6b2229e0555b.avif?t=1745388106\" width=600 height=214 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lighthouse Is My Home is a dynamic roguelite in which you play as a lighthouse keeper. A mysterious island full of dangers, events and secrets awaits you. Explore, die, revive again, but don't let the lighthouse fire go out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/8393ffdd6100d1e7fccad31946fdc426.poster.avif?t=1745388106\" width=544 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/8393ffdd6100d1e7fccad31946fdc426.webm?t=1745388106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/8393ffdd6100d1e7fccad31946fdc426.mp4?t=1745388106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Lighthouse Is My Home, you are the lighthouse keeper on a cursed island where everything is constantly changing in the fog. Set out to explore forgotten territories, harness the power of ancient artifacts by creating synergies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/8ee4f391bac9b8064e4e3c4b0ee4dba5.poster.avif?t=1745388106\" width=544 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/8ee4f391bac9b8064e4e3c4b0ee4dba5.webm?t=1745388106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/8ee4f391bac9b8064e4e3c4b0ee4dba5.mp4?t=1745388106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the lighthouse with valuable loot to become stronger! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/5677d018ee94bc6cc792406921f16693.poster.avif?t=1745388106\" width=544 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/5677d018ee94bc6cc792406921f16693.webm?t=1745388106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/5677d018ee94bc6cc792406921f16693.mp4?t=1745388106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New events will be waiting for you every day. Have pirates landed on the island? Have you decided to become a gladiator to earn money? Did a merchant ship crash? Make your own destiny!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/d0dca23c65f2eee7f3783bee005608b5.poster.avif?t=1745388106\" width=544 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/d0dca23c65f2eee7f3783bee005608b5.webm?t=1745388106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/d0dca23c65f2eee7f3783bee005608b5.mp4?t=1745388106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Lighthouse Is My Home is a dynamic roguelite in which you play as a lighthouse keeper. A mysterious island full of dangers, events and secrets awaits you. Explore, die, revive again, but don't let the lighthouse fire go out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/8393ffdd6100d1e7fccad31946fdc426.poster.avif?t=1745388106\" width=544 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/8393ffdd6100d1e7fccad31946fdc426.webm?t=1745388106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/8393ffdd6100d1e7fccad31946fdc426.mp4?t=1745388106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Lighthouse Is My Home, you are the lighthouse keeper on a cursed island where everything is constantly changing in the fog. Set out to explore forgotten territories, harness the power of ancient artifacts by creating synergies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/8ee4f391bac9b8064e4e3c4b0ee4dba5.poster.avif?t=1745388106\" width=544 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/8ee4f391bac9b8064e4e3c4b0ee4dba5.webm?t=1745388106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/8ee4f391bac9b8064e4e3c4b0ee4dba5.mp4?t=1745388106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the lighthouse with valuable loot to become stronger! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/5677d018ee94bc6cc792406921f16693.poster.avif?t=1745388106\" width=544 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/5677d018ee94bc6cc792406921f16693.webm?t=1745388106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/5677d018ee94bc6cc792406921f16693.mp4?t=1745388106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New events will be waiting for you every day. Have pirates landed on the island? Have you decided to become a gladiator to earn money? Did a merchant ship crash? Make your own destiny!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/d0dca23c65f2eee7f3783bee005608b5.poster.avif?t=1745388106\" width=544 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/d0dca23c65f2eee7f3783bee005608b5.webm?t=1745388106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3371460/extras/d0dca23c65f2eee7f3783bee005608b5.mp4?t=1745388106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
